      "skos:scopeNote": {
        "@value": "No source in the tree defines the term in a sentence (measured 2026-09-06). Sources that name it: the keyword list of EFC v2.1 Modular Synthesis (10.6084/m9.figshare.30455237; docs/papers/efc/EFC-v2.1-Modular-Synthesis/index.json), 'S1: Halo Model of Entropy' under 'Structure / Halo Layer' in docs/papers/efc/efc_master_v1/data/parameters.json, and a DefinedTerm in schema/pages-structure.json. The tree also disagrees with itself: figshare/figshare-links.json labels DOI 10.6084/m9.figshare.30421807 'Halo Model of Entropy (HME)', while figshare/doi-map.json, that paper's own index.json and Figshare title it 'Energy-Flow Cosmology: Field Equations for Entropy-Driven Spacetime', and its PDF does not use the term. That DOI is therefore not listed as a source, and the registry defines nothing here.",
        "@language": "en"
      },
